## REPOSITORY 
### Team Information
```python
wsba.repo_load_teaminfo()
wsba.repo_load_rosters(seasons=[20212022,20222023,20232024,20242025])
```

### Schedule
```python
wsba.repo_load_schedule(seasons=[20212022,20222023,20232024,20242025])
```

